# OpenSSL in the cryptography wheel vulnerable to the 2026-06-09 OpenSSL advisory)
# Bumped 48.0.1 -> 50.0.0; clears PYSEC-2026-3552 (PKCS7 RSA decryption
# Bleichenbacher oracle), PYSEC-2026-3553 (cert-chain exponential DoS),
# PYSEC-2026-3554 (wildcard SAN name-constraint escape) from the 2026-08-05 advisory refresh.
